        "725c193a-bbb5-443d-bebd-3841deb4edba": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How It Works",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Eye Star Vision Trainer is designed to help your eyes recover from prolonged screen exposure and fixed-focus fatigue. Instead of keeping your eyes locked onto a single distance for hours, the device encourages natural eye movement and visual re-engagement through guided tracking exercises.</p><p>• Helps relax overworked eye muscles after screen time<br/><br/>• Encourages smoother and more natural eye movement<br/><br/>• Supports visual comfort, focus flexibility, and recovery</p><p>The routine is intentionally simple and accessible — no apps, complicated setup, or learning curve required. Just follow the moving visual target for a few minutes a day and let your eyes actively disengage from static screen focus.</p><p>Whether you work on a computer, study for long hours, game frequently, or perform detail-oriented tasks, the portable design makes it easy to fit quick visual recovery sessions into your daily routine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "8196dec4-aaca-4aeb-9ae4-8e3e1ee4e641": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping Info",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>We offer fast and reliable shipping on all orders. You can expect to receive it within 6-12 business days based on your location.</p><p>Please contact our customer service team for assistance if you have any questions or concerns about your shipment.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
